 category correctly block creation, but nothing identifies the problem — no error text, no `aria-invalid`, no alert role. The button just does nothing.\n\nOne note on scoring: FT-1 passed on behavior, though duplicate username/email rejections are silent no-ops with no error message — the same missing-feedback pattern seen in CS-14, and worth fixing together."
